@host = http://localhost:5006

### 1. Login (seed admin from appsettings.Development.json) and copy the token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2. Report 1 - tickets Excel (optional ?status=Abierto|EnProceso|Cerrado)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/tickets
Authorization: Bearer <paste-token-here>

### 3. Report 2 - users Excel (Admin/Support only)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/users
Authorization: Bearer <paste-token-here>
